    "content": "<p>The Elimination Update comes to War Robots: Frontiers on <strong>March 2</strong>, and it&rsquo;s set to be jam-packed with new and improved content<strong>. </strong>Jump into shoot-&rsquo;em-up combat in the brand-new <strong>Elimination game mode</strong>, drop into battles alongside your friends with the Squad system, and enter the fray with two new Robots&mdash;<strong>Harpy and Fenrir.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>In the latest Dev Diary from Zukata, the Creative Director of War Robots: Frontiers, get all the details on the Elimination Update.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"embeddedContent oembed-provider-youtube\" data-align=\"center\" data-oembed=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nmQUSWgiJuI\" data-oembed_provider=\"youtube\" data-resizetype=\"noresize\" style=\"text-align:center\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"true\" allowscriptaccess=\"always\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"//www.youtube.com/embed/nmQUSWgiJuI?wmode=transparent&amp;jqoemcache=IkHsq\"></iframe></div>\r\n\r\n<p>Subscribe to our <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7xxqQkPAQ7x6wIVEPZus5w\">YouTube channel</a> and stay tuned for more War Robots: Frontiers videos!&nbsp;</p>",
